wth of 40% to 55% and a 19% increase compared to the midpoint of our previous guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/draftkings-inc-dkng-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2021-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jed Kelly","x":"And then as a follow-up, I guess with the VSiN acquisition, I mean, do you plan to create your own channel or put it on more streaming services?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/draftkings-inc-dkng-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2021-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"…our strong start to 2021 and underlying acquisition, retention, and monetization of players, we are increasing our guidance to 1.05 billion to 1.15 billion of revenue for 2021, which equates to year-over-year growth of 63% to 79%, and a 16% increase compared to the midpoint of our prior guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/draftkings-inc-dkng-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2021-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"The expanded relationship also includes rights to an innovative \"Bet & Watch\" streaming integration with fans with open and active mlb.com and DraftKings accounts will be able to watch a free live MLB game within the DraftKings app.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/draftkings-inc-dkng-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2021-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Chaiken","x":"You talked about MLB streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/draftkings-inc-dkng-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2021-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"Given our continued strong performance in 2021, and underlying acquisition, retention, and monetization of players, we are increasing our guidance to $1.21 billion to $1.29 billion of revenue for 2021, which equates to year-over-year growth of 88% to 100%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/draftkings-inc-dkng-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2021-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"We are increasing our guidance because of broad strength in fundamental customer acquisition, engagement and monetization trends as well as modest contribution from our three new states.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/draftkings-inc-dkng-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2021 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2022-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"We anticipate multiple channels for cost savings by, among other things, recognizing enhanced returns on advertising spend through marketing efficiencies and eliminating platform costs by migrating to DraftKings' in-house technology.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/draftkings-inc-dkng-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2022-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"This increased guidance does not include the contribution of the Golden Nugget Online Gaming business nor does it include our contemplated launch in Ontario.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/draftkings-inc-dkng-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2022-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"So we are increasing the outlook there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/draftkings-inc-dkng-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2022-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"We identified over $100 million of annual cost savings and has significantly slowed year-over-year fixed cost growth as evidenced by our Q3 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/04/draftkings-inc-dkng-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2022-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"There has been an ongoing effort throughout the year to drive and capture efficiencies, which has resulted in more than $100 million of in-year cost savings in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/04/draftkings-inc-dkng-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2023-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"And our expense management programs have already identified 100 million of cost savings for 2023, roughly 50 million from scale marketing efficiencies and another 50 million from people-related costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/17/draftkings-dkng-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2022 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2023-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"And I think that will be -- give us an additional boost, as well as provide ongoing cost savings, due to not having to pay revenue share to as many third parties.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/17/draftkings-dkng-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2023-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"And I think when I say synergies, not just the cost, obviously, there's cost savings, but also just having a superior product with better revenue and monetization on the players, smoother customer experience, easier to use, superior merchandizing, driving more cross-sell between games.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/05/draftkings-dkng-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2023-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robin Farley","x":"Is there enough organic growth from your existing states to maintain guidance even if you don't get multiple legalization this year for 2024?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/05/draftkings-dkng-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2023-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"…question, Kentucky definitely made a little bit of a difference but the fact that we were able to increase the guide for the back half of the year, increased the Q4 guide, I think really had to do with just the overall performance of the existing states that we're in and of the overall business…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/04/draftkings-dkng-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2023-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"And then as far as the question on streaming in the app, it's something we did look at and continue to look.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/draftkings-dkng-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2023-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Fishman","x":"And then just separately, with some of your competitors using that vision for streaming NFL games this year, can you discuss your updated thoughts on streaming live games in your app and whether you think there's any long-term benefits for DraftKings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/draftkings-dkng-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2023-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"And what we determined is they're not very material to next year, but they are there, and we do expect to see some impact on the cost savings side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/draftkings-dkng-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2023-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Park","x":"I'll hit the highlights, including our very strong third-quarter performance, increased 2023 guidance, and our initial expectations for 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/draftkings-dkng-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2024-02-16","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"And then, you know, on the streaming side, I think it's early to say.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/16/draftkings-dkng-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2023 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2024-02-16","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jed Kelly","x":"And then, my follow-up is, we're seeing these new streaming services start to pop up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/16/draftkings-dkng-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q1","e":"dkng","d":"2024-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"DraftKings is off to an outstanding start in 2024, and we're excited to be raising our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/draftkings-dkng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2024-08-02","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Robins","x":"In addition, we plan to integrate a bet-and-watch experience with NFL streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/draftkings-dkng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2024-08-02","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Fishman","x":"And then shifting gears a little bit, given the expected integration of the bet-and-watch experience with the NFL streaming, curious did you see anything last year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/draftkings-dkng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q2","e":"dkng","d":"2024-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Unknown Speaker","x":"There's obviously not much room to move in some states, like in New York and Oregon, but is the supply demand dynamic changed to the point that states with unused skins can maybe act as a renegotiation tool and be a serious lever to drive cost savings over the long term?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/06/draftkings-dkng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q3","e":"dkng","d":"2024-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"So I think between that and also wanting to be cautious on customer acquisition, we didn't feel comfortable raising the guide at this point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/08/draftkings-dkng-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2025-02-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jason Robins","x":"Secondly, I think beyond the product, really working with the broadcasters and the streamers to try to get low latency broadcasts and streams available for customers that want to in-play bet on a more micro basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/14/draftkings-dkng-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2025-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alan Ellingson","x":"And so you're going to see some fluctuations up and down as we pick up acquisitions, and we're going to optimize the organization and continue to focus on streamlining our organization and our fixed costs to get to a place where we can deliver the EBITDA margins we've communicated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/14/draftkings-dkng-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKNG 2024 Q4","e":"dkng","d":"2025-02-14","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Katz","x":"My sense is there may have been an urge to raise the guidance given the really strong start we've seen so far year to date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2